 1629: //    The intersection point happens when:
 1630: //    tt1(x2-x1) - tt2(x4-x3) = x3-x1
 1631: //    tt1(y2-y1) - tt2(y4-y3) = y3-y1
 1632:    
 1633: //    Assumption: the 4 points (including those of the side segment) are different.
 1634: //    The eqs. for the 2 lines are: X=X1+(X2-X1)*tt1 and X=X3+(X4-X3)*tt2.	
 1635: //    Output: false: no intersection or colinear; true: exactly 1 intersection.	
 1636: //    If true, (xIntersect,yIntersect) is the intersection.				
 1637: //    Modified to only check tt2, assuming 0<=tt1<=1 is already assured. 
 1638: // **/
